WEBVTT

00:02.570 --> 00:05.180
L-Lust...!

00:08.210 --> 00:10.069
Well, I figured.

00:10.070 --> 00:13.619
She lost to my blood, eh?

00:13.620 --> 00:16.829
Her blood should've been
pretty noble, too.

00:16.830 --> 00:19.369
Shut up! What did you do
to Lady Crusch?!

00:19.370 --> 00:20.499
How do I heal her—

00:20.500 --> 00:23.710
You just don't shut up, do you?

00:28.380 --> 00:31.300
So? Not gonna stab me?

00:31.730 --> 00:33.469
What's wrong?

00:33.470 --> 00:36.349
Don't you hate me?

00:36.350 --> 00:39.730
Don't you want revenge?

00:53.070 --> 00:55.410
Wh-Why...?

00:56.370 --> 00:58.450
I-It hurts!

00:59.040 --> 01:00.870
It hurts!

01:01.710 --> 01:04.250
Why... would you do...

01:05.170 --> 01:07.650
Y-You're the one
who told me to stab you!

01:08.300 --> 01:09.590
Unforgivable...

01:10.380 --> 01:11.969
I thought...

01:11.970 --> 01:14.010
I thought we loved each other!

01:15.050 --> 01:18.270
My bond with Lady Crusch
isn't something so shallow!

01:18.700 --> 01:21.059
Oh? That so?

01:21.060 --> 01:24.410
I guess I botched the performance then.

01:29.150 --> 01:30.610
Now...

01:31.200 --> 01:33.450
How are you going to beg for your life?

01:34.120 --> 01:38.040
How do I... Lady Crusch...

01:39.080 --> 01:42.499
You wanna know how to heal
a meatbag who's lost to Dragon blood?

01:42.500 --> 01:46.120
Dunno.
Heck, that's what I wanna know!

01:48.090 --> 01:49.840
That's enough.

01:53.180 --> 01:55.800
Looks like the plan didn't work, Ferris.

01:56.300 --> 01:58.640
There's no use talkin' to scum like her.

01:59.080 --> 02:04.229
Ishn't... thish fahce shupposhed toh...
be yer comrahde's?

02:04.230 --> 02:08.519
I knew you'd show up
after hearin' that speech.

02:08.520 --> 02:10.780
You're an absolute scumbag, after all.

02:11.260 --> 02:13.860
And who the hell are you supposed to be?

02:14.260 --> 02:19.700
Anastasia Hoshin,
the actin' proxy representative of this city.

02:28.500 --> 02:31.269
Didn't I say I knew you were comin'?

02:31.270 --> 02:33.009
Well, someone knows how entertain—

02:33.010 --> 02:38.550
And there's no merchant in the world
who wouldn't prepare to welcome their guest!

02:46.750 --> 02:49.150
That's more like it!

02:49.820 --> 02:52.189
I can't wait to take you back
and hold you tight!

02:52.190 --> 02:55.029
You're never gonna love
anyone else but me!

02:55.030 --> 02:56.490
Not happening.

02:58.240 --> 03:05.120
My aesthetics don't hold back against
someone who tries to hide their ugly face.

03:05.600 --> 03:11.050
No problem, 'cause my aesthetics
ain't gonna hold back on you too.

03:12.370 --> 03:14.510
I'm pretty pissed today.

03:15.000 --> 03:17.719
You'd better get your ass
outta here before I die,

03:17.720 --> 03:19.600
you damn mollusk!

05:02.990 --> 05:05.239
Why can't you get it?

05:05.240 --> 05:07.830
It's not a matter of brute strength!

05:10.370 --> 05:13.129
Did you think you could win
if you just kept hitting me?

05:13.130 --> 05:15.129
How childish can you get?

05:15.130 --> 05:16.919
Are you that stupid?

05:16.920 --> 05:20.249
You think I'm stupid, don't you?

05:20.250 --> 05:23.090
I guess it's time
to change things up, then.

05:28.810 --> 05:32.229
First up, "Plan I," was it?

05:32.230 --> 05:35.270
Insolent wretch! How dare you?!

05:37.170 --> 05:38.570
Now, Emilia-tan!

05:57.380 --> 06:00.210
Al Hyuma!

06:09.850 --> 06:14.100
Alright! Operation "In the Pond"
AKA "Plan I," success!

06:14.470 --> 06:16.399
I hope that worked.

06:16.400 --> 06:17.130
Watch out!

06:26.950 --> 06:28.199
Reinhard!

06:28.200 --> 06:32.370
Now that the biggest troublemaker
has finally left the stage—

06:34.730 --> 06:39.249
You just never listen, do you, woman?

06:39.250 --> 06:41.839
Everything you do is pointless!

06:41.840 --> 06:45.719
I am a perfect, complete individual!

06:45.720 --> 06:48.889
There is nothing more nor nothing less,
for one as fulfilled as I!

06:48.890 --> 06:50.599
Fulfilled?

06:50.600 --> 06:52.519
You're just a big fat liar!

06:52.520 --> 06:56.349
All you ever talk about
is want, want, want!

06:56.350 --> 06:58.980
You're just a really selfish person!

07:00.520 --> 07:04.649
If you're so fulfilled,
then take better care of your wives!

07:04.650 --> 07:08.490
But all you do is chain them down,
break their will...

07:09.240 --> 07:11.740
... and, and...!

07:13.950 --> 07:14.830
I get it now.

07:15.540 --> 07:17.540
I...

07:18.540 --> 07:20.250
I hate you!

07:20.710 --> 07:24.839
Y-You broad...!

07:24.840 --> 07:26.969
Yeah, well said, Emilia-tan!

07:26.970 --> 07:28.969
Nice job, but let's back off for now!

07:28.970 --> 07:29.469
But!

07:29.470 --> 07:32.969
We can't beat him unless
we figure out how his invincibility works!

07:32.970 --> 07:36.350
Remember our priorities!

07:43.430 --> 07:45.150
H-Hey, Subaru...

07:46.650 --> 07:50.740
I have a really bad feeling about this.

07:51.550 --> 07:53.080
What a coincidence.

07:53.540 --> 07:54.620
Me too.

08:02.170 --> 08:03.499
How's this?

08:03.500 --> 08:06.260
Try dodging it if you can!

08:14.100 --> 08:17.180
Run, run, run, run!

08:33.330 --> 08:35.909
Great thinking, Emilia-tan!
Nice one! You're so cute!

08:35.910 --> 08:37.779
Stop kidding around!

08:37.780 --> 08:39.489
It's hard to control, so take my hand—

08:39.490 --> 08:42.419
It happens every so often, you see...

08:42.420 --> 08:48.379
When I run into people like you,
who think they're so special!

08:48.380 --> 08:49.840
Gross!

08:53.050 --> 08:56.179
Subaru! I'm going to leave
one lesser spirit with you!

08:56.180 --> 08:56.929
Can you manage?

08:56.930 --> 08:58.349
Yeah, leave it to me!

08:58.350 --> 09:01.770
They didn't call me the princess on ice
as a kid for nothing!

09:19.370 --> 09:21.869
You dare aim only for my vital points?

09:21.870 --> 09:24.669
Have you no dignity as a woman?!

09:24.670 --> 09:25.959
You are unfit to be my bride—

09:25.960 --> 09:27.089
I already told you!

09:27.090 --> 09:29.219
I'm not going to be your bride!

09:29.220 --> 09:31.629
If I were, I wouldn't be
able to smile anymore!

09:31.630 --> 09:33.140
Emilia-tan!

09:41.060 --> 09:41.940
Emilia!

09:57.910 --> 09:59.199
Thanks, Subaru!

09:59.200 --> 10:01.329
It's fine! I'm loving it!

10:01.330 --> 10:04.519
Anyway, looks like plans V and B
didn't work.

10:04.520 --> 10:06.589
His vitals, heck,
even his balls are invincible!

10:06.590 --> 10:09.169
Where the heck is this guy's weak point?

10:09.170 --> 10:12.469
Why can't you simply accept
that it doesn't exist,

10:12.470 --> 10:14.930
you adulterous reprobates?!

10:24.940 --> 10:25.940
Reinhard!

10:35.490 --> 10:36.739
You're okay!

10:36.740 --> 10:38.029
Apologies for the wait.

10:38.030 --> 10:41.330
Why must you insist
on your absurdity?!

10:51.210 --> 10:52.840
Plan J!

10:55.590 --> 10:57.470
Fool!

11:12.860 --> 11:15.779
So we can't just turn his attacks
against him either...

11:15.780 --> 11:18.449
Damn, are we on the wrong track here?

11:18.450 --> 11:20.200
Am I missing something?

11:21.910 --> 11:24.909
Emilia-tan, I need hints.
Anything will do!

11:24.910 --> 11:27.630
Did anything happen
while you were captured?

11:28.920 --> 11:30.420
Anything...

11:30.880 --> 11:34.339
First, he asked me
if I was a "virgin," I guess...?

11:34.340 --> 11:36.009
Alright, he's dead.

11:36.010 --> 11:41.639
He calls his wives by numbers,
and when I said he's like a wicked king,

11:41.640 --> 11:44.059
she said he was a little king...

11:44.060 --> 11:46.560
Right, a little king!

11:47.140 --> 11:49.410
Little... king...

11:51.320 --> 11:52.780
The name of a star!

11:53.400 --> 11:56.739
Sirius, Capella, Alphard, Petelgeuse...

11:56.740 --> 11:59.410
They're all names of the stars I know!

12:00.260 --> 12:03.240
Regulus means "little king" in Latin...

12:04.120 --> 12:05.700
But it had another name...

12:07.460 --> 12:09.079
Subaru?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.289
Emilia.

12:10.290 --> 12:14.879
He grabbed you by the neck
in the church, right?

12:14.880 --> 12:18.400
Was his hand warm or cold?

12:20.090 --> 12:21.850
I couldn't feel anything.

12:22.370 --> 12:24.100
It wasn't warm or cold.

12:24.470 --> 12:28.560
It was like nothing was touching me.

12:29.060 --> 12:30.990
Like nothing...?

12:33.070 --> 12:39.030
Reinhard! Check if his heart is beating!

12:41.490 --> 12:45.409
Sorry for making you come all this way.

12:45.410 --> 12:46.750
Thank you.

12:47.190 --> 12:50.079
So that's the Archbishop of Wrath...

12:50.080 --> 12:52.329
Oh, I'm sorry for surprising you!

12:52.330 --> 12:55.459
The streets just seemed too dark tonight!

12:55.460 --> 12:59.170
Therefore, I overstepped my bounds a bit
and made it brighter!

12:59.670 --> 13:04.009
Oh, what's this?
You're surprisingly easy to talk to!

13:04.010 --> 13:06.889
Was my image of her wrong all this time?!

13:06.890 --> 13:11.689
My! What a delightful thing to say,
young lady!

13:11.690 --> 13:15.860
People can understand one another,
if we join hands, that is!

13:16.480 --> 13:17.529
Don't you think?

13:17.530 --> 13:20.239
Yes, absolutely!

13:20.240 --> 13:24.579
You're right, that's definitely love!

13:24.580 --> 13:26.079
Yes, exactly!

13:26.080 --> 13:28.580
Love! It's love!

13:30.080 --> 13:33.999
Sh-She's practically a saint!

13:34.000 --> 13:35.209
Lady Priscilla!

13:35.210 --> 13:37.939
Why don't we try talking things out
with her? What do you think?

13:37.940 --> 13:40.639
If we do, maybe... we won't even need
to resort to violence!

13:40.640 --> 13:43.719
Never would I have thought its effect
to be so immediate...

13:43.720 --> 13:46.680
Being highly receptive can be both
a blessing and a curse.

13:48.970 --> 13:50.600
Lady Priscilla—

13:53.230 --> 13:54.560
My~!

14:04.950 --> 14:08.579
Wh-What in the world was that just now,
Lady Priscilla?!

14:08.580 --> 14:12.829
Now that you've gone ahead and done it,
no one's gonna marry me now!

14:12.830 --> 14:16.289
Then it is the same for me,
who permitted the kiss.

14:16.290 --> 14:17.999
My actions brought you
to your senses.

14:18.000 --> 14:21.200
Besides, it was rather pleasurable
for you, was it not?

14:21.970 --> 14:26.200
My, my! You two must be lovers!

14:26.930 --> 14:29.559
Yes, to love is to create a bond—

14:29.560 --> 14:32.640
Enough. I grow tired of your drivel.

14:35.190 --> 14:40.320
Wait, wait, what!?
Where did all that familiarity go?!

14:40.900 --> 14:42.279
Why?

14:42.280 --> 14:44.699
How could you be so cruel?

14:44.700 --> 14:48.829
She was about to join me
in walking the path of love!

14:48.830 --> 14:50.290
Please look around you!

14:52.550 --> 14:54.619
Th-They're...

14:54.620 --> 14:57.579
Citizens who were gathered here.

14:57.580 --> 15:00.589
Please take a good look!

15:00.590 --> 15:02.519
Every last person is breathing as one!

15:02.520 --> 15:04.220
Not a single disruption to the harmony!

15:04.580 --> 15:08.510
The ultimate demonstration of love!

15:08.970 --> 15:11.969
Come! You too shall know it!

15:11.970 --> 15:16.230
The joy of being enveloped in love,
of becoming one!

15:27.450 --> 15:31.239
It seems your supporters are not
so eager to back your theory

15:31.240 --> 15:34.870
now that their lives are at stake.

15:35.910 --> 15:37.959
Return them to their senses.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.789
It is your role as the inheritor
of your songs.

15:40.790 --> 15:42.920
Fail, and only death awaits.

15:44.210 --> 15:47.839
Know that the lives of everyone
rest upon your throat.

15:47.840 --> 15:49.210
Quite an honor, isn't it?

15:50.910 --> 15:55.020
Well, I've never seen your type before.

15:55.520 --> 15:56.559
Yes...

15:56.560 --> 15:58.399
Yes, yes!

15:58.400 --> 16:03.229
Could it be that understanding you
was my trial?!

16:03.230 --> 16:05.029
Let me properly introduce myself...

16:05.030 --> 16:10.700
I am the Witch Cult's Archbishop of Wrath,
Sirius Romanée-Conti!

16:11.200 --> 16:13.700
I shall save you with universal,
impartial love!

16:14.290 --> 16:16.620
And once I have triumphed over this trial...

16:17.160 --> 16:22.090
His love will set me ablaze!

16:23.130 --> 16:24.839
My patience grows thin.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.340
Hurry it up, diva!

16:27.220 --> 16:28.470
Lady Priscilla?!

16:42.810 --> 16:44.899
Gah!

16:44.900 --> 16:46.189
Damn it!

16:46.190 --> 16:49.449
Let's do this, Liliana Masquerade!

16:49.450 --> 16:52.660
It's time for the performance
of the century!

16:59.370 --> 17:01.000
Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear!

17:01.460 --> 17:03.380
My, my, my!

17:04.500 --> 17:07.919
I've never met anyone
as stubborn as you before!

17:07.920 --> 17:13.889
What could have possibly caused your heart
to seal itself shut so tightly?

17:13.890 --> 17:18.099
The likes of you could never
understand my motives.

17:18.100 --> 17:19.389
But I shall not give up!

17:19.390 --> 17:22.809
For doing so is to admit this world
is nothing but darkness!

17:22.810 --> 17:25.360
I want to save you!

17:25.720 --> 17:31.279
Have you mistaken the act of
concealing weakness for strength?

17:31.280 --> 17:34.569
There are peaks that can only be reached

17:34.570 --> 17:36.870
by bonding with others
and standing together!

17:38.080 --> 17:41.869
Your delusions are nothing
but meaningless prattle—

17:41.870 --> 17:44.840
Then what of this?

17:46.000 --> 17:48.960
Iris and the Thorn King.

17:55.010 --> 17:58.470
Check if his heart is beating!

18:01.450 --> 18:03.310
I can't have you looking
the other way now.

18:04.940 --> 18:07.610
Do not misunderstand, Sword Saint.

18:08.150 --> 18:13.279
I've only been indulging you out of
the generosity and patience of my heart.

18:13.280 --> 18:17.489
But even someone as kind
as me has his limits, you see!

18:17.490 --> 18:18.490
I see.

18:19.220 --> 18:21.709
It seems Subaru's hunch was correct.

18:21.710 --> 18:22.870
Wha...?

18:26.500 --> 18:31.800
I wonder if you've ever experienced
falling into the sky!

18:33.090 --> 18:34.089
Reinhard!

18:34.090 --> 18:35.219
Subaru.

18:35.220 --> 18:37.050
Your hunch was correct.

18:37.560 --> 18:39.930
His heart isn't beating.

18:41.000 --> 18:44.480
Sorry, it might take me
some time to get back.

18:46.730 --> 18:49.149
Nice one, Reinhard.

18:49.150 --> 18:49.779
Subaru!

18:49.780 --> 18:52.650
It's our turn! How do we fight him?

18:53.110 --> 18:54.910
Emilia-tan, lend me your ear for a bit.

18:55.610 --> 18:57.120
Be sure to give it back, okay?

19:05.750 --> 19:08.959
Are you two discussing
how to beg for your lives?

19:08.960 --> 19:11.209
Now listen here, it's far too late—

19:11.210 --> 19:12.630
Now listen here!

19:13.300 --> 19:15.049
Haven't you noticed?

19:15.050 --> 19:18.760
We've got you cornered!

19:19.180 --> 19:20.099
What?

19:20.100 --> 19:21.849
Alright, I'll fill you in.

19:21.850 --> 19:24.269
You've got the right to hear it,
after all.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.559
You love your rights, yeah?

19:26.560 --> 19:29.309
I have... the right to hear it?

19:29.310 --> 19:30.399
Right,

19:30.400 --> 19:37.900
'cause you'd probably die from shame
if you lost without knowing why.

19:38.760 --> 19:40.239
You dare...?!

19:40.240 --> 19:41.619
We'll win.

19:41.620 --> 19:43.789
We're gonna make him cry,

19:43.790 --> 19:47.250
and you're gonna let me carry you
like a princess one more time.

19:49.210 --> 19:49.960
Dummy.

19:53.880 --> 19:56.340
Ul Hyuma!

20:02.760 --> 20:07.189
You talk a big game about defeating me,
and yet here we are again!

20:07.190 --> 20:11.730
Do you honestly think that I'll give in
if you keep attacking me for eternity?

20:14.610 --> 20:15.740
Regulus!

20:16.240 --> 20:19.450
I know the true nature of your Authority!

20:21.200 --> 20:23.290
Oh? Intriguing.

20:23.790 --> 20:27.900
You, of all people,
claim to understand me?

20:29.000 --> 20:29.710
Wait.

20:30.710 --> 20:33.920
Where did you hide #79?

20:34.300 --> 20:39.259
Answer me! Where is #79?
You were trying to take her away—

20:39.260 --> 20:43.739
Ewww, you really do call your wives
by numbers! Gross!

20:43.740 --> 20:45.719
'Sides, you actually thought
I'd answer you?

20:45.720 --> 20:49.139
Is that skull of yours empty?

20:49.140 --> 20:52.770
Or was that a desperate attempt
to switch subjects?

20:53.820 --> 20:56.689
Very well, I shall listen.

20:56.690 --> 21:01.989
Though the words of a craven
may not be worth believing,

21:01.990 --> 21:04.490
I am a merciful man.

21:04.930 --> 21:06.829
Merciful, eh?

21:06.830 --> 21:09.749
Well? Aren't you going to speak?

21:09.750 --> 21:12.169
Or perhaps you can't?

21:12.170 --> 21:14.669
If that was merely a bluff
you came up on the spot—

21:14.670 --> 21:17.630
Nah, I'll answer you, Regulus.

21:18.720 --> 21:21.930
The true nature of your Authority is...

21:23.010 --> 21:26.470
Being able to press
the pause button in-game!

21:28.230 --> 21:29.229
...Hah?

21:29.230 --> 21:35.860
Or how about we call it Lion Heart,
the ability to stop time for your body?

21:36.360 --> 21:38.570
Alright, let's see if we got it right.

21:39.200 --> 21:42.029
Yup, your face says everything.

21:42.030 --> 21:45.030
THE BATTLE AGAINST GREED
Yup, your face says everything.

23:16.000 --> 23:19.379
"Iris and the Thorn King"?

23:19.380 --> 23:24.840
Or maybe, Teleos' Rose Knight?
Magritzer's Gibbet?

23:27.400 --> 23:29.000
Die.

23:29.600 --> 23:30.720
Lady Priscilla?!
